WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.680
Welcome to Relationships into Opportunity. I’m Brian Kennedy

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:07.600
Jr. Relationships can make education and entrepreneurship an

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:11.440
adventure, but they also involve real limits, unequal

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:14.800
access and other people’s choices. We will work

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:17.120
with that honestly. You will start with a

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:20.160
question you want to understand, find appropriate people

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:23.840
or resources, and practice a small, respectful request.

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:27.280
Then you will compare internships and other experiences

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:30.560
by the work, feedback, costs and support they

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:33.360
actually offer. The goal is to build useful

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:36.720
relationships and make informed choices. You do not

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:39.280
need a famous contact, a reply or an

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:42.400
internship offer to demonstrate learning here. You need

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:45.920
preparation, a clear request, an accurate record and

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:48.560
a next step. You can practice through role-play

00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:51.440
if contacting someone is not appropriate. Open the

00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:53.760
first lesson and write one question about a

00:00:53.960 --> 00:00:56.320
field, role or problem you want to explore.
